---- MODULE Frontends ----
EXTENDS TLAPS
VARIABLE x, y
A == x' = 2
P == x = 1
THEOREM (A \cdot A) => TRUE
  BY ExpandCdot
THEOREM ENABLED A => ENABLED A
  BY ExpandENABLED, AutoUSE
THEOREM ASSUME NEW ACTION B, NEW ACTION C PROVE ENABLED B <=> ENABLED C
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
THEOREM ASSUME P, P \in BOOLEAN, A \in BOOLEAN, ENABLED (P /\ A) PROVE P /\ ENABLED A
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
====
